TWEAK_NAME="Wi-Fi boot off the busy core"
TWEAK_RISK="high"
TWEAK_EXPERIMENTAL=1
TWEAK_DESCRIPTION="Pins the Wi-Fi bring-up services to the second CPU core with affinity_mask=0x02 in /jci/sm/sm.conf, so they do not compete with the interface for the first core. Services this firmware does not define are reported and skipped; the patch proceeds when at least one is present."
